{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──将安洁接回家。", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "早上被她叫醒、和她一起上学，我的生活理所当然地出现了许多变化……", "text_idx": 485, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是对我来说，最大的变化或许是这个。", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥。”", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sk0961", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "顺带一提，现在是出门上学前的一小段空档。", "text_idx": 500, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁不在，客厅里只有我和樱乃两人。", "text_idx": 467, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……哥哥？”", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sk0962", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，没事。”", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁来我们家之后，樱乃即使和我两人独处也不再叫我“葛格”了。", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我当然不会做出当面询问她这种不识趣的事情。", "text_idx": 474, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我感觉得出来这是樱乃用她自己的方式做出了区隔，我也该认真地面对。", "text_idx": 475, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的主要身份已经不是“樱乃的葛格”，而是“安洁的主人”了……", "text_idx": 477, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，抱歉，只是在发呆。”", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“恋爱脑？”", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sk0963", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“想说说看不习惯的词。”", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sk0964", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈哈。”", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过不管怎么说，我还是很感激樱乃能用正面的态度去接受我们家的变化。", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我觉得自己必须更可靠一点才行。", "text_idx": 480, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "先不说这个。", "text_idx": 459, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了吗？”", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。应该说，已经发生了。只是忘记说。”", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sk0965", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“昨天去了银行，看到这次的汇来的金额比以前都还要多。”", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sk0966", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“生活费？”", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sk0967", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以就打了电话问。”", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sk0968", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、嗯……然后呢？”", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说是给哥哥的贺礼。”", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sk0969", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的脸热了起来。", "text_idx": 478, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不只是樱乃，连爸妈都……", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我也要打通电话才行。”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥的害羞真难得一见。”", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sk0970", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃轻描淡写地说，喝完了杯中的茶。", "text_idx": 488, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我越来越体会到自己能走到今天，都是多亏了身边人的帮助。", "text_idx": 481, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呀啊呀啊、居然有贺礼……”", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1899", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁好期待和大主人、大夫人见面的那一天……”", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1900", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我觉得他们应该也很期待。”", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我打算今天晚上打电话给爸妈，安洁要不要也讲几句话？”", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好的！请务必让安洁讲电话，安洁也要向他们道谢！”", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1901", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……有些紧张呢，主人。”", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1902", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔，有吗？”", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“有。”", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1903", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁越来越觉得身边的大家都在关照着我们……”", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1904", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──安洁本身也出现了许多变化。", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她基本上是个活泼开朗的女孩，不过最近常常能感受到她成熟稳重的言行举止。", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "类似沉稳……的感觉吧？还有最明显的是散发出了“女性魅力”这样的气氛。", "text_idx": 494, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不只是这样。", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……对了，主人。”", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1905", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？”", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……♪”", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1906", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁拉了拉我的袖子，温柔地整理我的制服。", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“主人的这边总是立刻就皱起来了。”", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1907", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，这样啊……抱歉抱歉，谢谢你。”", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不会不会，安洁也是开始烫主人的衣服后才发现的。”", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1908", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今后每天都会为您整理衣着的，呵呵，请放心吧。”", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1909", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……谢谢。”", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "照顾我时的眼神、表情和动作，果然和之前有点不一样了。", "text_idx": 490, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "真正意义上的越来越像女仆……是吗？", "text_idx": 493, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“？”", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1910", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──有种年轻太太的感觉。", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管怎么说，虽然害羞但我还是很开心的。", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感觉安洁越来越绽放出原本的样子了。", "text_idx": 473, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好甜蜜喔，你们两个～♪”", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": "ht0346", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔喔吓我一跳！”", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，还是吐槽了……明明我都这么努力装没看见了……”", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "ar4044", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸、欸！”", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1911", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“该该该不会很引人注目吗爱理同学！？”", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1912", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“全校最引人注目的就是你们。”", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 496, "voice": "sn0362", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“默默等他们自己结束就好了，真是的……”", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "ar4045", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀，哈哈哈，这种状况就是要闹一下才有趣吧～”", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": "ht0347", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、啊唔唔……”", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1913", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来我们的对话都被大家看在眼里了……", "text_idx": 492, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唉，事到如今也没办法……是说瓜生君你没注意到吗？”", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "ar4046", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊～欸……不好意思……”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“整个松懈了呢，瓜生新吾以前的样子。”", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "ar4047", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "无话可说。", "text_idx": 484, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过我可以像这样放松，完全都是多亏（？）了安洁。", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼……唔呼呼呼……”", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1914", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“主人整个人都放松了，呀哈真是的，安洁没有比这更幸福的事了～～！”", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1915", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“痛！好痛！住手住手！我听不懂你在说什么幸不幸福啦！”", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 496, "voice": "sn0363", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁显然对我的改变非常高兴。", "text_idx": 470, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她高兴就好。所以我也没有什么意见。", "text_idx": 465, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，安洁的微妙变化大家显然都看得出来。", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我去一下学生会。”", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“或许可能有事要拜托安洁，所以你可以在这边等我吗？”", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好的，遵命！”", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1916", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“请代替安洁向会长问好，主人。”", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1917", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，那我走了。”", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理同学和隼太同学也慢走，安洁的主人就拜托两位了。”", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1918", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好啦好啦，就这样吧。”", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": "ht0348", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在安洁的目送之下，我们三人前往学生会。", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "顺带一提，是为了不久前开始运作的组织改善委员会的事。", "text_idx": 499, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "基本上现在已经拟出了改善的草案，管理学校方面委托安洁的工作。", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "像这样介入让命令系统明确、统整压在安洁身上的资料，借此改善整个组织的感觉。", "text_idx": 458, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不好意思，明明是我叫你们来的。”", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……刚才那样的确很难打扰呢。”", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "ar4048", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为小濑名很容易害羞嘛。”", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": "ht0349", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“揍你喔！”", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "ar4049", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就是希望变成这样才帮助你的。如果打扰的话就本末倒置了。”", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "ar4050", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……万分感谢。”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然很感谢他们，不过也因此让羞耻的程度加倍了。", "text_idx": 497, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过……”", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "ar4051", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁已经完全展现出自己了呢。”", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "ar4052", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，是吗？”", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“已经不再怯缩，天真烂漫的女仆。”", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "ar4053", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈哈哈，变成像天羽学姐那样吗？”", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": "ht0350", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“感觉不太相同……嗯～该怎么说呢。”", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "ar4054", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“人妻感。”", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": "ht0351", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就是这个！”", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "ar4055", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以从旁边看着都莫名不好意思了起来……不过也好啦，这样也好啦……”", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "ar4056", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……呃。”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我虽然害臊，但还是回应了她的话。", "text_idx": 479, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我觉得那是安洁的‘女仆’这一面喔。嗯……现在才终于渐渐地……”", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "ar4057", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真是夸张的情侣。”", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "ar4058", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔哈哈。”", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": "ht0352", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……既然有新婚感就表示已经做了吗？”", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": "ht0353", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%164;“唔！”", "text_idx": 6, "plain": "“唔！”", "plain_idx": 371, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喂喂，就算再怎么在意也不能问得那么直接啦！”", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "ar4059", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“濑、濑名同学也很在意啊……”", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔唔。”", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "ar4060", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因、因为你们住在一起不是吗！？当然会在意了，毕竟安洁那个模样！”", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "ar4061", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这个……”", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没想到比起我们当事人，身边的人更在意“那件事”啊……", "text_idx": 489, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过这也表示在大家眼中，我们进展得很顺利吧……", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之，是秘密。”", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“也、也是啦，你保密就好了。”", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "ar4062", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“少女心还真是复杂呢～”", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": "ht0354", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“男生这么单纯真好呢。”", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "ar4063", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……也难怪他们会在意，毕竟那件事的确很重要。", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "或许差不多要认真考虑了……", "text_idx": 482, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔。”", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sk0971", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了，樱乃？”", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯嗯。”", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sk0972", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯嗯嗯？”", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃……？”", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我猜不出她想说什么，于是跟着来到走廊。樱乃打开她的房门，往里面看。", "text_idx": 476, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁。”", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sk0973", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是、是的……已经照你说的在房间里喊了几声……”", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1919", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁刚才在樱乃的房间里。", "text_idx": 468, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这是什么意思呢？？？”", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1920", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯。”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sk0974", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥的房间听不到。”", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sk0975", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我在考虑要不要把房间搬到一楼，不过如果是在哥哥的房间发生的话，好像就没问题。”", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sk0976", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼欸？”", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1921", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以，请不必客气。”", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sk0977", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“该不会……樱乃？”", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、主、主人！”", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1922", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sk0978", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 152, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她是在担心明明感情很好，但迟迟没有“做了”的迹象的我们……？", "text_idx": 464, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 153, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要不把耳朵贴在我房间的门板上就不会听到，所以请便的感觉……", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 154, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“等一下等一下等一下你想太多了！”", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 155, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也有点罪恶感。”", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sk0979", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 156, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是那个意思，不是那个意思啦！”", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 157, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸、欸！？怎怎怎么回事呢！？”", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1923", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 158, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小姑其实也会在意很多事。”", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sk0980", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 159, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就说不是了！”", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 160, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼啊～请不要丢下安洁径自讨论啦～”", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 466, "voice": "ag1924", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
